{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Gift Collector [\u30ae\u30d5\u30c8\u30b3\u30ec\u30af\u30bf\u30fc]",
    "steam_appid": 3344150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344150/extras/8e3fae85e0b5d5c177d28c8264b81d4c.avif?t=1734329357\" width=640 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gift Collector [\u30ae\u30d5\u30c8\u30b3\u30ec\u30af\u30bf\u30fc] -</strong> this is a New Year's horror game from the first person, in the Japanese style and genre of walking simulator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every year, with the beginning of winter, you begin to receive a large number of letters. These letters are children's rays of hope for a miracle. You often read a lot of unusual stories and wishes in them. And you need to make each of these wishes come true. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On New Year's Eve, dreams come true, no matter how you behaved last year. Because of this, both children with diligent behavior and those who did not do the best things receive their gifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344150/extras/1dbf3c546377694301efcdef27c12680.poster.avif?t=1734329357\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344150/extras/1dbf3c546377694301efcdef27c12680.webm?t=1734329357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344150/extras/1dbf3c546377694301efcdef27c12680.mp4?t=1734329357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You will take on the role of Santa Claus. Collect gifts according to the wishes of the children. And on New Year's Eve, go deliver them. You will need to act quickly and quietly so as not to wake anyone up.\u00a0 Stylized graphics and high-quality 3D sound will help you fully experience the atmosphere of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Walking simulator;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- First-person view;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - The effect of shooting on an old camera;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344150/extras/8e3fae85e0b5d5c177d28c8264b81d4c.avif?t=1734329357\" width=640 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gift Collector [\u30ae\u30d5\u30c8\u30b3\u30ec\u30af\u30bf\u30fc] -</strong> this is a New Year's horror game from the first person, in the Japanese style and genre of walking simulator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every year, with the beginning of winter, you begin to receive a large number of letters. These letters are children's rays of hope for a miracle. You often read a lot of unusual stories and wishes in them. And you need to make each of these wishes come true. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On New Year's Eve, dreams come true, no matter how you behaved last year. Because of this, both children with diligent behavior and those who did not do the best things receive their gifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344150/extras/1dbf3c546377694301efcdef27c12680.poster.avif?t=1734329357\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344150/extras/1dbf3c546377694301efcdef27c12680.webm?t=1734329357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344150/extras/1dbf3c546377694301efcdef27c12680.mp4?t=1734329357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You will take on the role of Santa Claus. Collect gifts according to the wishes of the children. And on New Year's Eve, go deliver them. You will need to act quickly and quietly so as not to wake anyone up.\u00a0 Stylized graphics and high-quality 3D sound will help you fully experience the atmosphere of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Walking simulator;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- First-person view;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - The effect of shooting on an old camera;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.</p>",
    "short_description": "Gift Collector [\u30ae\u30d5\u30c8\u30b3\u30ec\u30af\u30bf\u30fc] - this is a New Year's horror game from the first person, in the Japanese style and genre of walking simulator. Collect gifts and make the kids happy on New Year's Eve. But don't forget that Midnight is a time of miracles!",
